1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,060
Groups allow you to map users to their relevant roles.

2
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:13,160
This enables you to assign the permissions for a chosen set of roles to all the users

3
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,000
in the group.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,460
Users in the group inherit the permissions that are defined in the assigned roles, subject

5
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,360
to restrictions on sites.

6
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,740
Each user can belong to multiple groups.

7
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,620
They inherit the roles and permissions from all the groups that they belong to.

8
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:33,400
You can also use groups to restrict users to certain parts of the site tree.

9
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:38,460
To create a new group, log in to PubSuite Enterprise Edition as the administrator.

10
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:44,540
From the team menu, select groups, click new group, enter a group name.

11
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:48,260
In the roles tab, select the roles that you want to assign to the group.

12
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:54,220
In the users tab, select the users that you want to assign to the group and click save.

13
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,140
You can edit a group as follows.

14
00:00:56,140 --> 00:01:00,140
Again, make sure you're logged in as an administrator.

15
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,920
From the team menu, select groups.

16
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:05,540
From the list, click the group that you want to edit.

17
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:08,940
Use the roles and users tabs to edit the group settings.

18
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:11,680
When you're finished, click save.

19
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,520
You can only delete custom groups.

20
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:15,920
You can't delete built-in groups.

21
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:20,920
To delete a group, again, ensure you have administrative privileges.

22
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:23,540
From the team menu, select groups.

23
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:27,920
Find the row for the group that you want to delete and use the delete icon.

24
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,920
At the prompt, click delete.

25
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:30,920
At the prompt, click delete.

26
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,920
At the prompt, click delete.

27
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,920
At the prompt, click delete.

